      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-10T20:53:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not inserting a rule, the ruling that allows for -hp states that only in Certain Specific situations can a target go into negative HP. &nbsp;We seem to have interpretted that to mean things always go into negative HP if they take more damage than they have hp, which doesn't seem like the intent of the ruling at all.</p>",
